@startuml
skinparam dpi 300
scale max 2000 width
title System Admin: Configure System

|System Admin|
start

:Manage Service & Device Infrastructure;
note right
  **Tasks include:**
  * Authorize new Top-up Counters
  * Link RFID/IoT devices to locations
  * Update Service Catalog (Library, Canteen)
end note

if (Infrastructure Valid?) then (No)
  :Flag Configuration Error;
  stop
endif

:Perform Wallet Security Audit;

if (Abnormal Activity or Loss Reported?) then (Yes)
  :Execute Wallet Lock/Unlock;
  note right
    Immediate freeze on balance
    to prevent unauthorized use.
  end note

  :Log Security Intervention;
endif

|Internal Wallet System|
:Commit System State Changes;
:Synchronize Authorization Registry;
note right
  Ensures IoT devices recognize
  newly authorized cards or counters.
end note

|System Admin|
:Verify System Health & Connectivity;
stop
@enduml